                <custos xml:id="m-86c4a9fc-0680-4e93-958b-d02cb4470b05" facs="#m-fb3bf0dc-4d95-4bff-8d12-fe4b2fc32452" pname="d" oct="4" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-aa380053-f9d4-4f57-be96-0c31006efa0a">
              <lg xml:id="m-0471ec23-4bb3-44fb-8144-618c2b2e9256">
                <l xml:id="m-6f81bc15-cfff-46fa-bf05-0988e1491111" facs="#m-b894fa68-39c3-4972-b03e-1701a21ddb36" label="ambiguous">478</l><l xml:id="m-8fea186f-1299-4ccb-bba2-e54c611f49fa" facs="#m-ea73075e-2a73-4cb2-b90f-1bd7211877eb" label="text-like">Sunday within the Octave of the Epiphany.</l><l xml:id="m-862c5c0a-d005-4a7b-b5d6-42f50299791e" facs="#m-e9d29a07-027f-4999-8b2e-86415ebbd1b3" label="lyrics-like">in ae- térnum. Ps. Jubi-láte Dé-o ómnis tér¬</l><l xml:id="m-31ff84c6-a0b0-483a-80ed-a9834206dd58" facs="#m-c4f5cbe3-7875-4d69-bb50-6481ffdadb79" label="ambiguous">est</l><l xml:id="m-9f0450a7-14ea-4480-a57d-28b3f820519d" facs="#m-c355b857-6d04-4667-92e1-e516e999913f" label="lyrics-like">in laetí-ti-a. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-43348e7e-bc28-4f58-86c4-062b7c6c5525" facs="#m-f0d33ca0-b435-4c09-94d0-1ca3e7477f28" label="lyrics-like">ra: * serví-te Dómino</l><l xml:id="m-4069eb0b-34d6-4cd3-a482-fb69bbb4ec2a" facs="#m-306d2dad-1e42-4421-985f-4e975a722b36" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-d762043d-de6f-4dba-b3b5-c189b591fa40" facs="#m-a6b6801e-c68b-4bb1-8b75-f5918a29bcc4" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-6e9f9b70-a77c-45a8-9802-87277dcdfcef" facs="#m-4778db60-205a-4503-bc4f-35df529f9e0f" label="lyrics-like">yOta, quaésumus Dómine, sup-! sunt, vídeant, * etad implénda quae</l><l xml:id="m-e6cf2709-7338-48b5-9590-2ea76fa658ec" facs="#m-7ff7967e-fd7c-433f-b285-1f96f2755578" label="lyrics-like">Yplicántis pópuli caelésti pietâte</l><l xml:id="m-1db744a5-cd01-478a-94c8-b6b5c0aa19f1" facs="#m-6a84f7b7-9113-400e-a328-9655408bb6d3" label="lyrics-like">víderint, convaléscant. Per Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-145ff839-ba61-4a3c-988e-d240ce6193de" facs="#m-32f4b9c6-a323-4e50-897d-df43a636b886" label="lyrics-like">proséquere:t ut et quae agénda! num.</l><l xml:id="m-6f59047a-01aa-4448-aa9d-d29a484d1976" facs="#m-8cf9b805-fad8-4ed6-adfd-030e8c730942" label="lyrics-like">Second Collect or the Epiphany: Deus, qui hodiérna. p. 459.</l><l xml:id="m-c2a37359-dd3d-4c91-b200-76f5f6459acc" facs="#m-cc7c3a5a-1448-4256-9408-41d63171cb99" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Romanos. Rom. 12.</l><l xml:id="m-aa207314-ced6-4527-9130-44cab2a1c2b0" facs="#m-4cffa95f-a0e1-46f7-82c8-841cf316b87a" label="lyrics-like">NRatres: Obsecro vos per miseri-[vos: Non plus sápere quam opórtet</l><l xml:id="m-237a9c2e-c20b-4a93-816f-53af20bd38a4" facs="#m-d24a0a92-b500-45e8-876b-f0df031cd87b" label="lyrics-like">córdiam Dei, ut exhibeátis cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-32e2d2c9-41e4-480f-9221-87fc8c4d0dda" facs="#m-8f81b165-29c9-4aeb-a3ac-aa20aabd8259" label="lyrics-like">sápere, sed sápere ad sobrietátem:</l><l xml:id="m-6396110e-b40e-4071-b1a7-3b4a50aa88f0" facs="#m-e8c5992c-8caa-48a0-8bb8-43936de14422" label="lyrics-like">pora vestra hóstiam vivéntem, san¬</l><l xml:id="m-936b0f57-9a22-40a9-a2e0-33ccf27e3e7d" facs="#m-cea72330-4817-493b-aa1c-928f0dbe2f3f" label="ambiguous">et unicuique sicut Deus divisit men¬</l><l xml:id="m-e0568496-3a89-45e7-b6e3-e07af787537d" facs="#m-f028668b-ef99-4577-b1d9-c79a3a5dad2f" label="lyrics-like">ctam, Deo placéntem, rationábile</l><l xml:id="m-6cba2f7f-0f77-448b-b359-9da135803397" facs="#m-e8f71c97-30bc-4143-a56c-39ffe4cba506" label="lyrics-like">súram fidei. Sicut enim in uno cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-0acba607-6c01-4eae-82c0-e67384832269" facs="#m-e39af24a-ce01-40b7-96fa-53bd5169b124" label="lyrics-like">obséquium vestrum. Et nolite con¬</l><l xml:id="m-430e72f9-9d38-4890-97e1-34cb8c1d8875" facs="#m-8366fad7-087a-404c-a047-784d0670181c" label="lyrics-like">pore multa membra habémus,</l><l xml:id="m-a123e406-ff46-454f-b8e3-c0c23c0ade1f" facs="#m-1dacf8e4-b0f4-4005-8ba6-a3843ee20ca5" label="lyrics-like">formári huic saéculo, sed refor¬</l><l xml:id="m-40201d86-0dc9-4c46-8bc4-9dcebd62ff9e" facs="#m-8b53535a-6bf2-4db8-a570-1bd332dc8a7c" label="lyrics-like">ómnia autem membra non eúmdem</l><l xml:id="m-c6e79788-052e-4d51-9060-9dc23fa0c029" facs="#m-ad9e1953-23fd-4a19-905b-60083d9a9c0c" label="lyrics-like">mámini in novitâte sensus vestri:</l><l xml:id="m-7f3d7339-6e4f-4968-821f-18cec5947fa9" facs="#m-81d77568-2f16-413b-9e7c-37547a5670f1" label="ambiguous">actum habent: ita multi unum cor¬</l><l xml:id="m-4ac7a4b0-4a2a-4801-b528-9cd083cd9b73" facs="#m-95bcc26f-eea7-4243-9980-8871858b1812" label="ambiguous">pus sumus in Christo, singuli autem</l><l xml:id="m-c9e4d819-de0a-41a1-897f-fdd5e5975c69" facs="#m-70bc3e05-b8fd-439d-96bb-381f9b516f18" label="lyrics-like">ut probétis quae sit volúntas Dei</l><l xml:id="m-4f75729b-06d7-47a2-81de-c007b6084ab2" facs="#m-43f18e4b-af47-41ad-8b9d-574f603188f5" label="lyrics-like">bona, et benéplacens, et perfécta.</l><l xml:id="m-e5b68bf0-0610-43b3-9e6a-49400c3407db" facs="#m-bd71df73-2250-4487-bfbc-f29215a6ae16" label="lyrics-like">alter altérius membra: in Christo</l><l xml:id="m-6b889e93-a76c-4c0a-a609-02808ffd070b" facs="#m-14476759-a150-4836-81af-7780008245c5" label="lyrics-like">Dico enim per grátiam, quae data</l><l xml:id="m-d3225a35-ad55-46aa-b05c-76f1bbf94605" facs="#m-8ef8ed92-9811-4b24-bc23-f5ff28624cab" label="lyrics-like">Jesu Dómino nostro.</l><l xml:id="m-12ccec2c-10a5-41c2-8c0c-bc8da35914b3" facs="#m-ab25d600-4892-4f30-bd02-1de62c80a014" label="lyrics-like">est mihi, ómnibus qui sunt inter</l><l xml:id="m-376bad68-d834-40b7-8848-c736996d7e8b" facs="#m-4ee52182-c77f-49f4-ad6c-e5aff48b8d3d" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-7498205b-8f36-4657-b7b7-47cfa9eeb7da" facs="#m-37fab764-001c-4e38-a3e0-71fab54a45e1" label="ambiguous">7</l><l xml:id="m-82c1f734-b280-446b-8f53-e7d0f0dd9a44" facs="#m-679a10fb-6793-4f4c-8dba-b5431b27b214" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-d2ea4316-3fa8-484d-8790-def62c59c5e8" facs="#m-9252787b-75c9-4724-813c-212ffcdb83a7" label="lyrics-like">Dó-minus</l><l xml:id="m-d1c2079d-3ee7-48d8-ae8a-a1fba91d1663" facs="#m-ed81f2a7-18f6-47d5-a144-96ce08e87de5" label="lyrics-like">Enedí¬ ctus</l><l xml:id="m-83375068-b317-4b1f-b2ed-919250164478" facs="#m-4e4c8ee6-7955-4f7a-a155-f8d14732ea04" label="lyrics-like">Dé¬ us Is-ra¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d1e7668-ac32-4729-a531-8dc826bc6552" facs="#m-4b08e867-997a-4600-a21f-218ce6db4341" label="lyrics-like">qui fácit</l><l xml:id="m-10c9bfa3-03ea-430f-a5fe-7eddf2e5baef" facs="#m-2a95d6e1-69ef-471b-b650-a911e1e2143f" label="ambiguous">el,</l><l xml:id="m-2f18d231-028a-476c-b5f0-bd1c63d72642" facs="#m-d8e84f27-5b67-455c-8da1-c08b75a200b1" label="lyrics-like">mi-rabí- li¬ a má¬</l><l xml:id="m-7d07352e-d987-418a-8552-9f39cb09d515" facs="#m-0bae424c-baf9-43c6-a922-50fd1e340894" label="lyrics-like">gna só¬</l><l xml:id="m-db5828ab-5e97-458d-8653-000fd55dc3ee" facs="#m-7b4571e5-e98e-4949-92bb-b1320958debf" label="ambiguous">lus</l><l xml:id="m-d6876b71-8d58-4f47-8205-6aed857a68d7" facs="#m-36358276-6d55-4cf7-b343-6a6f17c0eb1c" label="lyrics-like">a saé¬ cu¬</l><l xml:id="m-07e1ddc6-f3f8-46a5-8357-c914467973bc" facs="#m-1d5ab2f1-2b50-4f98-bed7-1bc6401c78a6" label="ambiguous">lo.</l><l xml:id="m-8f4705a6-1a9e-4477-be2a-8fc65a86d8e9" facs="#m-f53441af-110c-450f-979a-21c4f43da1fe" label="lyrics-like">V. Suscípi¬ ant món¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
